      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01676",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“是啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes, that is true.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01676",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "年轻姑娘也会想到这种问题吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do young girls think about such things too?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01676",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "父亲回头看了看樟树，然后目不转睛地望着女儿说，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her father turned back and looked at the camphor tree, then gazed steadily at his daughter and said,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01676",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "“你讲得有道理。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What you say makes sense.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01676",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "万物就像你那头亮乌乌的头发，都在延伸成长……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "All things, like that glossy black hair of yours, are stretching out and growing...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01676",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "爸爸的脑袋瓜不灵啦，老糊涂啦！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Your father's mind is not working well anymore; I have become a muddled old man!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01676",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "不，你让我听到了一番精彩的谈话。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No, you have let me hear a wonderful conversation.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
